<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">Kaala</book>
  <para style="h">Kaala</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kaala</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kaala</para>
  <para style="mt">Kaala</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipi adim a umna khopi, bang achileh lungzuonga tou mawh ata diei! Namte lah a liensa nu, bang achileh meithai banga hing um ata diei! Gamkaite lah a leengtanu bang hinapi bangzieh a, gamdanga toukai khota hing suoh tavalong adiei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zan chiengin hasetah in akap a, abiengte ah hituite aluong hi, a it angaite lah ah ama hamuonding koima a um sih hi. Alawmte zousie’n ama lepchie tahin abawl ua, amelma asuoh siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suhgentheina leh sepgimna nuoia saltang dingin, Juda apeita hi; namte lah ah atenga, khawldamna amu sih hi. Ama gawttute zousie in, apatau seng ziehin adelphata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zion zotna lampite angui zouta, pawi bawlnate koiman ahing siim nawnlou ziehin, kulkotte akisegawpta a, anungah siengthoute suhgenthei in a umta, amanu lunggim tahin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amelmate atunga vaihawm in apangta ua, agalte alawchingta uhi; Akhelna tampite zieh un, Mangpa’n dana athuoh sahta hi. Amelmate mai ah atate saltang dinga, puimangin a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion tanu apat in amelhoina zousie apeimangta. Amiliente zousie lah loudawng mu zoulou, sazuhtal abangta ua, ama delte mai ah thahatna neilou in ataita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem in suhgenthei a aum lai nite leh, alungkham a um lai in, nidanglai anopsahna zousie ageldoh hi. Amite, a galte khut a apua ua, koiman apanpilou tah in, agalten ama amu ua, akiehngiemna anuisat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem in khelna huoisetah abawl a, tuaziehin abua gawpta hi. Ama zatat zousie’n asimmawta ua, aziehpen amaun asaguohna a muta uhi, Ahi, chimawin akihei mangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asienthoulouna aniih ah abaang a, atawpna ding angaituo kha sih hi; tuaziehin apuana achizat huoi senga, ahamuon ding koima a umsih hi. “Aw Mangpa suhgenthei a ka umna en in, ka galpa akiguolzousah sengta hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Agalten amanu gou manpha zousie tungah akhut azah a, amunsiengthou sunga namte lut amuta a, na mi kikhawmte lah a, lut dinga na phalloute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amite zousie achimaw ua, nah ging vahuoi in neh ding asui ua, ahinna uh humbitna dingin agou manphate u’toh, ann neh ding aheng ua, “Aw Mangpa hing en inlen simmaw a ka um dan ngaituo in!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nou lampi a vah leh peite a ding in, tami bangma lou ahiei mah? En unlen mu vawi un, Mangpa’n alungthahna zauhuoi ni a, ka tunga ahing tunsah ka gimthuohna, gimthuohna dang toh kibang mawngmawng a um ei mah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ama’n tunglam akipat mei ahing sawl a, ka gu ka taangte sungah thuhtah in alut hi; Ama’n ka kengte awhna dingin len azah a, ahing kinuahei sah a, sun nitum a khophawhlou a ba in ahing nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ka bawlkhelna hahkol khu a khuta kaan in aum a, phankhawm ahi uh, tualeh ka ngawng ah ahing kibaat a, ka thahatna abeisah hi, Mangpa’n ka nanzouloute khut ah ang pekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka lah a ka galhatte zousie Mangpa’n atuonchilta a, ahing dou ding leh ka khanglaite tuonchil dingin, galkapte ahankhawma, grep zu chil bangin Mangpa’n, Juda nungah siengthoute atuonchilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tam silte ziehin ka kap a, ka mit ah hitui aluong hi, ka hinna suhal dinga, hamuon ding mi kei akipat in agamla hi; ka galte a guolzaw taah zieh un, ka tate tasam in alieng vaita uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zion in akhutte azahkhie a, hinanleh ama hamuon ding koima aum sih hi. A innvengte amelma asuohna dingin, Jakob tung thu ah Mangpa’n thupieh abawlta hi. Jerusalem khu amaute lah ah sil sienglou asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mangpa khu adihtat a, kei pen athupieh kalin kana helta hi. Tuin mite zousie aw, ngai un, tualeh ka lungkhamna en un, ka nungahsiengthoute leh, ka tangvalte sal a puimangin a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ken ka it ka ngaite ka han a, hinanleh amaun ahing solta ua, Ka siempute leh ka upate lah ahinna uh, humbitna ding a aneh ding uh asui lai un, khopi sungah ashita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa ka genthei dan en ve! ka hinna abuoi gawpta a, Ka lungtang ka sungah akilumleta hi; aziehpen nasatahin kana helta hi. Pulam ah namsau a leenga, innsungah shina a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Amauten ka chimaw thumna a za ua, Koima kei hing hamuon ding a um sih hi; Ka galte zousie in ka patauna azata ua; na bawldan mu in akipah uhi. Na puondohsa ni na hing tungsah dinga, ama u’zong keima bang ahing hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Agitlouna zousie uh na masangah hing tung henlen, ka bawlkhelnate zieh a ka tunga na bawl bangin, amau’tungah bawlin; aziehpen ka lungdonna atam sengta a, ka lungtang abata hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangchidan a Mangpa’n Zion tanu alungthahna meilumpi a apumtuom adiei! Israel melhoina van apat lei ah apaikhie a, tualeh alungthah ni in akengngahna athei ngitnget sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Jakob tenna zousie avaltum siengta a, ahepi zouta sih hi. Athangpaina in Juda tanute kulpi dettahte achimsahta a, amaute tuol ah apaikheta hi, Ama’n leenggam leh leengtate, asubua ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman alungthahna zauhuoitah in Israel kii zousie asattan piehta hi; amelmate masangah, ama apat in akhut zietlam anua lahdoh kiata hi. Tualeh Jakob tungah akim avel, katum meikuong bangin akata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Melma bangin athalpi aluoi a, melma bangin akhut zietlam toh adinga, amitmu a kilawm zousie athatta a, Aman alungthahna meikuong bangin, Zion tanu puonbuh tungah asungbuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa khu melma bang ahita a, aman Israel avaltumta hi, Aman aleeng innpite zousie anawmvalta hi; akulpi dettah asusie a, Juda tanute lah ah suunna leh kana apungsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’n abiehbuh khu huon bangin hiemngam tah in alamangta a, akikhopna munte uh asuhsiet pieh a; Mangpa’n pawi thupite leh khawlnite Zion amanghil sahta hi; athangpaina ziehin leengpa leh siempu anuolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n amaitam anuolta a, amunsiengthou ataisanta hi, Ama’n leeng innpi kulbaangte agalte khut ah apekheta hi. Amaun pawi bawlni thupi bangin, Mangpa inn ah akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n Zion tanu kulbang suhsiet atumta hi. Aman tena khau azankhie a, suse lou dingin akhut anualah kia sih ding hi. Tuaziehin leikichieng leh kulbaangte, daa leh kap in, angui khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akulkotpite lei ah atum a, akamna zawlte asusie a atawngsan sah hi. A leengpa leh aleeng tapate namte lah ah a um ua, dan a um nawn sih hi. Guolneiten Mangpa akipat in kilaahna amu nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion tanu upate tuol ah atou ua, hamlou in a um uhi, alutung uah leivui akibuoh khum ua, sai ip puon sil in a um uhi. Jerusalem nungah siengthoute, lu tuol lam ngain akun suh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hitui ziehin ka mit amiel gawpta, ka lungtang abuoi gawpta a; Ka sinkha tuol a sunbuoh ahita; ka mite tanu suhmangthai ahizieh in, naupangte leh naungehte kholai dung ah, sidangin abuhshi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaun anute kung uah, “Bu leh uoin hei a um ahiei?” achi uhi; Khopi gawlzing teng a, shibup a aluplaiun, anute uh angsungah ahinna uh sunbuoh a aum lai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanga dinga bang ahiei ka gen thei ding? nang bang toh kangte thei diei, Aw Jerusalem tanu? ka hing hamuon theina dingin bang toh kang tekah diei? Aw nungah siengthou Zion tanu! Na sietna tuipi banga alet ziehin, koi in ang sudam thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na guolneiten nanga dingin, mengmuna dihlou leh mot huoi amu ua, na saltanna ua pat hing kinuale na dingin, na khelna uh, ahawhkhe sih uhi. Hinanleh nang a dingin mengmuna dihlou ahing mupieh ua, puikhelna genlawhna ahing genpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na kunga hing peikhate pouma in khut ahing beh khum ua, Jerusalem tanu enghou in alu athinkhum ua, “Tami khopi himaw, kilawmna bukim leitung pumpi kipahna achi u’khu?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na melmate zousie in, nang gensietna in akam uh akah ua, engham in aha uh agawt ua, “Amaute’n amanu inawmvalta uhi, Tami ni khu galdot a ingah zing ni ngei u’khu ahi a, itangta ua, imuta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa’n alungtup abawlta a, nidang lai a athupieh atangtung sahta hi. Ama’n apaikheta a, alainat tasih hi, na tungah na melmate akipahsah a, Ama’n na melmate kii atawisangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Alungtang uh Mangpa kungah akikou khie a, Zion tanu kulbang aw, Na hituite luipi bangin sun leh zan in luong henlen, khawldamna kipe vawt sinlen, na mitte zong tawlnga sah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thou inlen, zanlai in kikoukhie in, zan ven hun kipat chiil in, Mangpa mai ah na lungtang tui bangin sungkhie in, gawlzing tenga gilkiela buhshi ding, nataneute hinna dingin, ama kunglangah na khutte zahtou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Mangpa en inlen, ngaituo vawi! tami koi kung abawl na hiei mah? Numeiten agil ua ga atate uh, aduot mama u’leh, a ang ua apomlai atate uh, sa ne talawm ding ahi uoi mah? Siempu leh guolnei Mangpa munsiengthou a, kithat talawm ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khangdawng leh tehsete kholai dunga, tuol lah ah alum ua, Nungah siengthoute leh tangvalte namsau in apuata uhi. Nangman amaute na lungthahna niin na that a, lainatna neilou in amauh na thatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawi bawl ni a mite na hatkhawm bangin, ka kim ka vel ah zauna na hankhawm hi. Mangpa lungthahna ni ah Nuasie leh, suohta koima a um sih hi. Ka dontei ka khawilette leh, ka galten asumangthaita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Akungthahna chieng zanga suhgentheina, mupa khu keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’n ahing pui a, vah ah hilouin miel lah ah ahing pei sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’n ka tungah pellou in akhut ahing ha a, sun nitumin ahun hun in ahing thuoh sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’n ka tahsa leh ka vun avuoi sah a, ka gu kataang atawngsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’n kei ahing simta a, khatna leh tunggihna in ahing imkuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’n nidang lai a shisate bangin, miel lah ah ahing koita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama’n ka pawtdoh theilouna dingin, ka kimkot ah dai ahing kaikhum a, ka khainieng bu agih sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kap a ka kikou chieng nangawn in, ka thumna ahing kha pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’n suong kikhengte in ka lampi akhasan a, ka lampite akawi sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama khu kei a dingin vompi mi ngah a lum bang ahia, humpibahnei mi buhdap bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama’n ka lampi aheimanga, ahing mal neen a, hing taahlou in ahing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama’n athalpi aluoi puoh a, athaltanga ngim dingin ahing taadoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Athal bawm a thaltangte ka sisan guizamte ah alutsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite zousie nuisat ka hing hita a, sun nitum in la el toh ahing eng hou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’n khatna in ahing dimsahta a, annkhapi tui ahing dawnsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama’n ka hate suongtat in ang suhtawng pieha, vut ahing buohkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangman lungmuonna apat, ka hinna gamlapi ah na suonmang a, nopsahna ka manghilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Ken “Ka hatna leh ka kinepna, Mangpa akipat abeimangta hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thuohgimna leh ka vahvaina gamsai leh, khatna thei ngitngetin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hinnain tuate athei zing nalai a, ka sungah lungkie in akunsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami ka lungsim in ka phawhkhe kia a, Tuaziehin kinepna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa khotuona zieh a nehgam a umlou ihi, aziehpen alainatnate azuou ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuate zingmawng chin in atha zel a, Na gin umna alien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mangpa khu ka tanvou ahi,” ka hinna in achi hi, “Tuaziehin ama ah ka kinem hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mangpa khu ama ngahte ading leh, hagau a suite dingin ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi’n kinemtah leh sipkhinkhian a, Mangpa hundamna angah ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi’n akhangdawnlai a, hahkol apuoh ama a dingin ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sip khinkhian in amatangin tou hen, aziehpen Pasian in ama tungah angata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama’n akam leivui lah ah koi hen, kinepna a um thei nahlai na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama’n aphebengpa langah aphe dawhenlen, gensietna in dim hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa’n kumtawn in apaidoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lunggim dana hing tungsah nanleh, alainatna tamdan dungzui in, khotuona alangsah nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama’n, gimthuohna a ut mawnga ang tunsah ahi sih a, mihing tate zong asuh lunggim ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Leitunga suongkul tangte zousie, akeng nuoi a tuonguoi dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tungnung Sangpen masang a, mi khat dihna heimang pieh dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Atuon aval a mikhat tunga thudih, heimang pieh Mangpa’n pha asa sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mangpa’n thu apieh loupi a, thugen a, tangtung sah thei koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tungnung Sangpen kam akipat, asie leh apha hing pawtdoh hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Akhelnate zieh a mi khat akigawt chienga, bangdinga phun ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />I lampite uh suichien in, enchien vaiin, Mangpa lam ah kinuale kia va ui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />I lungtangte u’leh i khutte uh, van a Pasian kungah domsangtou va ui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Koute kana khielta ua, kana helta ua, nang lah nang ngaidam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Lungthahna in na kituomkhumta a, na hing nuadel a, lainatna neilou in na that ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Meilum in na kituomkhum ta a, tuachi’n ka thungetna uh apeisuoh thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Koute mipite lah ah buathah leh, silnieh paikhawm bangin na hing bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Ka melmate zousie un, koute douna in akam uh ahing kahkhumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zauna leh thang ka tung uah, ahing tunga sietna leh manthaina toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka mipite tanu suhmangthai a a um zieh un, ka mit ah hitui luitui luong bangin aluong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Ka mit ah hitui khawl lou, tatlou in aluong ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mangpa’n van apat in ahing en suh a, ahing mu masangsie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ka khopi tanute zousie ziehin, ka mit in ahing lungkham sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Ka melmaten azieh bei in va beh bangin, ahing beng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ka hinna beisah tumin ka hingtangin, kokhuh sungah ahing pailut ua, ka tungah suong asep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tui in ka lu atum manga, sattan a um hitavang ka chi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“Suongkul sung ngiempen akipat, na min ka hing han hi, Aw Mangpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nangman ka aw na zata hi, panpina ngen a, ka hu la a, ka kikouna ah na bil hum sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Nang ka hing hat niin na hing nai a, zau sin na hing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa, ka hinna tungtang thu nang nahing gen pieh a, ka hinna na tandohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka tunga sildihlou kibawlte na muta a, ka tungtang thu hingkhen pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Aphuba lah dan uh na muta a, ahing phielguh dan zousie uh na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa ahing gensietna zousie u’leh, ahing phielguhna zousie uh na zata a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Ka melmate, kei hing dou a sun nitum tum a, akidap hounate uh na zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Atou suh uleh, adindoh uh, en vawi, a enghouna la uh ka hita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa akhut nasep uh dungzui in, amaute thuhkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Amaute lungtang khau sah inlen, na hamsietna atung uah tuta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na lungthahna in, amaute nuadel inlen, Mangpa van nuoi akipat in sumang in.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangachileh sana khu hing muolta ahiei! bangachileh sana sieng sitset amel hing kiheng ata diei? Mun siengthou suongte, gawlzing tuohchilna mun tengah akithethangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amanpha mama Zion tapate sana banga manphate khu, bangachileh belkhengte khutsuoh, leibelte bang giap a ngai ahita uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Si-alte nangawn in zong anoute uh vahna dingin, anawite uh apie ua, atep sah uhi, hinanleh ka mite tanu khu gamdai a, gamva ngawnsang bangin ahing gilou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naungeh nawinete lei khu dangta na ziehin, adangtawng uah abeh a, Naupangten ann angen ua, koima’n ape sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ann tui tahtah nete khu, kholai dungah amangthaita uhi, puonsandup sil a khanglienten vutvum akawita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite tanu gitlouna gawtna khu, Sodom khelna gawtna sangin anasa zaw a, khut mawngmawng in akhoi khahlou a, mitphiet kallou a suhsiet a um khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amiliente uh vua sangin asieng zaw ua, nawitui sangin angou zaw uhi, amauh tahsa pum rubi suong mantamte sangin, chisan suoh zaw a, amel latdan uh saphire suongmanpha abang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin vang amel latdan uh innking sangin, avom zaw uh a, gawlzingte ah koiman athei theita sih uhi, avunte uh agu uah abeh a, chiengkang gaw abangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kiel a shite sangin namsau a shite ahampha zaw uhi, aziehpen tam miten lou apieng ann anehlou zieh un, agawngtam suh suh ua, gilkiel in apuashi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lainatna hau numeite khutin, amauh tate sa ngelngel ahuon ua, amaute ka mite tanu suhmangthai a a um lai a; a ann uh ahi talawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n athangpaina asutangtungta a, alungthahna zauhuoitah asungbota hi. Aman Zion ah mei atawkuongta a, tami’n asuongphumte akatumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Melmate leh galte, Jerusalem kotpite ah lut thei va uh chi, leitung leengte leh khovel a tengte zousie in, agingta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Alah ua midih sisan suo, aguolneite khelna zieh leh asiempute gitlouna zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaute mittote bangin gawlzing tengah avahvaita ua, sisan in akisubua ua, koiman apuonsilte uh nangawn atham ut tasih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miten akung uah: “Peimang un! Siengloute!” peidoh un, peimangun, “Hing khoikha sih un!” chi’n miten akikou khum uhi. “Amaute ataimang ua, avahvaina lah ua namte lah a miten, “Amaute tam mun ah um nawn sih va uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangpa ngel ngel in amauh athezah a, a ngaisah nawn sih ding hi. Mipiten siempute azatat nawn sih ua, Upate adeisah nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Panpina thawn ngah in ka mitte uh avai siengta a, ingah ulah ahing hundam theilou nam khat, ngah ihi bou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I gawlzingte ua ipei theilouna dingun, miten isulnua azui uh, itawpna ding anaita, inite akimta, itawpna uh ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ei hing nuadelte lah vanlaizawl a, muvanlai sangin a gang zaw ua, muolte tungah ahing nuadel ua, gamdai ah ahing buhdap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Inahkohawm ua ihaina hu uh, Pasian sathau nusa khu, akokhuh ua laah in aumta a, namte lah a “Ama halim nuoi ah ihing diing uh,” ina chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nuom inlen, kipahin, Aw nang Uz gam a teng Edom tanu; Nou khu nang kungah zong ahing tung ding a, na kham dinga, na kihawhkhe dinga guohtang in na um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu na gitlouna gawtna khu abukimta hi; Ama’n saltang dingin ahing sawlmang nawn sih ding hi; Aw Edom tanu, na gitlouna, aman ahing gawt ding a, Aman nakhelna ahawhkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka tung ua hing tungte thei ngitnget in, Ngaikhie inlen ka zalatna uh en in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka gouluote uh meltheilou mite kunga, lehei ahita a, Ka innte uh gamdang mite kungah akipeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Taga leh pa neiloute ka hita ua, ka nute uh meithai bang ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tuisihte uh aman nei in ka dawnta ua, ka singte uh ka kung ua zua ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngawnga hahkol vaw toh naw in ka um ua, ka semgim mama ua, khawldamna ka mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Neh ding ann khamkhop ka mu theina dingun, Iziptte leh Assiriate kungah khut ka daw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pu leh pate uh ana khiel ua, a um nawn sih uh, hinanleh kouten akhelna gau uh ka pota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suohten ka tung uah vai ahawm ua, akhut ua kipat hing hundoh ding koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamdai a namsau ziehin ka hinna uh, mansuo ding zauna toh ann neh ding ka mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka vunte uh lungthukhuh bangin asa hi, kiel ahuoisiet seng ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion ah numeite apawngsuol ua, Juda khopite ah nungahsiengthoute, pawngsuol in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengtate akhut un akhailum ua, upate akizatat nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tangvalte buhehna suong ahehsah ua, Pasal naupangte singtun gihtah nuoi ah akisui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upate lah kulpi kot ah atoukhawm nawn sih ua, khanglaiten lah tumging tum nawnlou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungsim kipahnate uh atawpta a, ka lamnate uh lu sunna asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lutung ua pat manglukhu aketa, ka tung uh agih hi, ka kheltah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami ziehin ka lungtang uh abata a, tam silte ziehin ka mit uh amiel gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zion muol khu nuasie a aumtah ziehin, si-alte atungah agamtata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang khu aw Mangpa, kumtawn in na umzinga, na Mangtoupha zong akhang akhangin a umden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh a koute nang manghil den tahlawm a, tualeh tamtanveipi nang taisan ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma langah hing kiheisah in Aw Mangpa, tuachi’n nang lamah ka hing nuakia ding uhi; nidanglai bangin ka nite uh thasah kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Koute hing nuol den a, ka tung ua lungthah den nata amah!
  </para>
</usx>
